  "body_html": "<h1>Information Set</h1>\n<p>For player $i$, information is represented by a partition\n$$\n  \\{P^i_k\\}_{k\\in K_i}\n$$\nof player $i$'s decision nodes. A part $P^i_k$ is an information set. Nodes in the\nsame information set cannot be distinguished by player $i$ and must have the same\navailable physical actions.</p>\n<h2>References</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>[MFoGT, Section 6.3.1] Laraki, Renault, and Sorin, <em>Mathematical Foundations of Game Theory</em>, <code>references/MathFoundationsGameTheory.pdf</code>. Information of player i is a partition of that player's decision nodes.</li>\n</ul>",
  "proof_html": null,
